    "text": "<p>A steel block of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> rests on a horizontal floor as shown. When three iron cylinders are placed on it as shown, the block and cylinders go down with an acceleration <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> The normal reaction <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>R</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></math> by the floor if mass of the iron cylinders are equal and of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> each is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mtext>in</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>,</p><p>[Take <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"\"><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/129f0964-5a13-4b9c-940b-5fb28f659d76-image.png\" style=\"width: 364px; height: 204px;\" /></p>",
