  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/129f0964-5a13-4b9c-940b-5fb28f659d76-image.png\" style=\"width: 364px; height: 204px;\" /></p><p>Writing force equation in vertical direction,&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>a</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>[</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>686</mn></math>&nbsp;newton<br />Note: Since there is no compressive normal from the sides, hence friction will not act.<br />Hence option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
